Causal attention allows a position to use its own and earlier positions, but not later ones. This small filter shows that access rule; it is not a Transformer.

```javascript
const position = 1;
const positions = [0, 1, 2];
const allowed = positions.filter(index => index <= position);
console.log(allowed.join(", "));
```

It prints 0, 1. Position 2 is later, so it is excluded.
